WEBVTT

00:00:39.417 --> 00:00:42.751
Your magic is no match for me.

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:44.626
Is that all you've got?

00:00:55.751 --> 00:00:57.085
It's futile.

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:00.667
You don't know anything at all!

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:18.369
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven.

00:01:31.665 --> 00:01:34.180
How is this possible?
It's Double Talents!

00:01:59.493 --> 00:02:01.693
This is my true power.

00:02:03.212 --> 00:02:04.212
Keep that in mind.

00:02:04.992 --> 00:02:13.210
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:02:14.482 --> 00:02:17.635
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:02:17.889 --> 00:02:20.585
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:02:20.684 --> 00:02:24.671
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:28.307
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:02:29.137 --> 00:02:32.479
♪ Smoke appears in
conflicted dimensions ♪

00:02:32.791 --> 00:02:35.429
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:02:35.811 --> 00:02:40.356
♪ Protecting the unshakable
belief within us ♪

00:02:40.596 --> 00:02:42.494
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:46.993
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:50.755
♪ Shocked by what had appeared
in front of us ♪

00:02:51.141 --> 00:02:54.187
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:02:54.342 --> 00:02:57.627
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:01.162
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:03:01.256 --> 00:03:05.340
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:08.102
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:03:08.103 --> 00:03:12.511
♪ That unique soul was
born to be a hero ♪

00:03:12.654 --> 00:03:15.781
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:03:15.821 --> 00:03:19.706
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:03:19.728 --> 00:03:22.571
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:03:22.572 --> 00:03:28.108
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:03:28.315 --> 00:03:32.406
♪ I promise ♪

00:03:36.245 --> 00:03:37.498
I can't believe it.

00:03:37.919 --> 00:03:39.372
He has the Double Talents?

00:03:39.692 --> 00:03:41.419
They are both level three!

00:03:42.174 --> 00:03:43.320
A prodigy!

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.296
A prodigy indeed!

00:03:56.334 --> 00:03:58.686
You owe me an apology.

00:03:58.893 --> 00:04:00.979
Mo Fan, don't cross the line here.

00:04:01.304 --> 00:04:03.397
I didn't ask him to apologize.

00:04:16.504 --> 00:04:17.272
Brother?

00:04:24.953 --> 00:04:28.044
My brother, I let you down back then.

00:04:28.286 --> 00:04:31.430
I shouldn't have been so reckless.
Please, forgive me.

00:04:32.516 --> 00:04:35.161
Brother Zhuoyun, you don't need to.

00:04:35.292 --> 00:04:37.206
Please, get up.

00:04:37.486 --> 00:04:39.127
Brother, that is enough.

00:04:43.108 --> 00:04:45.387
The winner is Mo Fan.

00:04:45.959 --> 00:04:50.959
He will now has the right to accept
training at The Sacred Spring.

00:05:16.043 --> 00:05:18.763
Here, to the person
that surprised everyone,

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:20.900
the man that bring us honour, Mo Fan.

00:05:22.114 --> 00:05:24.366
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

00:05:27.855 --> 00:05:28.869
The food is ready.

00:05:29.389 --> 00:05:31.976
Brother Fan, you were amazing back then.

00:05:32.791 --> 00:05:33.738
Of course.

00:05:34.184 --> 00:05:37.229
You are born with two Talents?
That is cheating.

00:05:37.425 --> 00:05:39.542
-Here.
-I am not cheating.

00:05:41.137 --> 00:05:43.457
Mo Fan, I envy you so much.

00:05:43.587 --> 00:05:47.425
Your Fire Talent is strong enough,
and now you have a second talent?

00:05:47.709 --> 00:05:50.043
and it's the rare Thunder Talent.

00:05:50.751 --> 00:05:53.502
Mo Fan has a bright future ahead of him.

00:05:53.959 --> 00:05:56.520
Whether it's the Hunters' League,
Association of Magical Societies,

00:05:56.688 --> 00:05:58.147
the army or the privileged schools,

00:05:58.421 --> 00:06:00.821
I believe he has plenty
of choices to make.

00:06:01.343 --> 00:06:03.917
We can't lose our fighting spirit
because of that.

00:06:04.213 --> 00:06:06.320
Use the time you have
and make a final push,

00:06:06.373 --> 00:06:08.993
work hard to get into the
Magic College of your choice.

00:06:09.535 --> 00:06:12.637
Brother Fan, you are going to the
Sacred Spring next week?

00:06:12.694 --> 00:06:14.480
Yes, for seven days.

00:06:14.625 --> 00:06:17.359
After that, you will be able to
use Starchart magic?

00:06:18.723 --> 00:06:21.682
The training at the Sacred
Spring won't be easy.

00:06:22.131 --> 00:06:24.594
-Brother Fan, good luck.
-Sure.

00:06:32.654 --> 00:06:33.361
Hello?

00:06:33.603 --> 00:06:34.874
Father, don't lock the door.

00:06:34.875 --> 00:06:35.888
I'll be home soon.

00:06:36.197 --> 00:06:38.901
Sure. Let me prepare
some food for you.

00:06:39.779 --> 00:06:41.994
-What would you like to ear?
-Don't bother.

00:06:42.265 --> 00:06:45.784
I just had my dinner with friends.
I am only going back for a visit.

00:06:46.611 --> 00:06:48.074
Okay, that is all right.

00:07:06.397 --> 00:07:08.504
I never thought he was born
with Double Talents.

00:07:08.934 --> 00:07:09.987
I underestimated him.

00:07:11.125 --> 00:07:13.834
Yu Ang didn't get qualified
to enter the Sacred Spring.

00:07:14.105 --> 00:07:15.212
The plan failed.

00:07:15.927 --> 00:07:18.420
They higher-ups want progress now.

00:07:19.997 --> 00:07:21.504
Please, give me another chance.

00:07:21.624 --> 00:07:23.759
I promise you,
we will succeed the next time.

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:26.550
But your failure...

00:07:27.005 --> 00:07:28.819
must be punished.

00:07:40.294 --> 00:07:44.143
You actually want to come along?
I was just ranting the other day.

00:07:44.224 --> 00:07:46.077
You want me to teach you
the releasing of magic.

00:07:46.243 --> 00:07:47.789
I agree and here I am.

00:07:48.085 --> 00:07:50.992
My Orbit magic stops when I get nervous.

00:07:51.593 --> 00:07:54.259
I am a lousy mage with Water Talent.

00:07:56.909 --> 00:07:59.833
Come on, stop thinking about
how you might fail.

00:08:00.714 --> 00:08:06.132
Well, think of the Stars like
they are a bunch of fairies.

00:08:07.901 --> 00:08:09.007
Stupid Xiaohou.

00:08:11.086 --> 00:08:11.940
What's wrong?

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:18.287
Isn't that Brother Fan and Xinxia?

00:08:18.427 --> 00:08:20.347
I thought he is at the Sacred Spring.

00:08:21.078 --> 00:08:21.909
It's a date.

00:08:23.496 --> 00:08:25.709
How is shopping together a date?

00:08:26.125 --> 00:08:29.001
A boy and a girl shopping together
is almost like a date.

00:08:30.491 --> 00:08:33.171
So, are we on a date as well?

00:08:36.263 --> 00:08:38.901
It's time for training,
I need to go now!

00:08:40.266 --> 00:08:42.894
Hey, I was just joking!

00:08:43.596 --> 00:08:45.423
Do you really like this colour?

00:08:45.825 --> 00:08:48.406
Yes, this is special.

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:50.587
There are plenty of
good-looking bracelets,

00:08:50.818 --> 00:08:52.991
why did you buy something
that looks so funky?

00:08:53.444 --> 00:08:54.551
It's all right.

00:08:54.633 --> 00:08:57.753
This is the birthday gift you gave me.

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:00.130
And we picked this together.

00:09:01.961 --> 00:09:03.721
You are 16 now, Happy Birthday.

00:09:04.938 --> 00:09:05.738
Thank you.

00:09:06.542 --> 00:09:07.178
Brother Fan.

00:09:07.943 --> 00:09:09.175
Why are you still here?

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:11.763
Shouldn't you be at the
Sacred Spring for training?

00:09:12.056 --> 00:09:13.233
Why are you here?

00:09:13.889 --> 00:09:15.875
I am picking a birthday gift
for my sister.

00:09:16.136 --> 00:09:18.763
Brother Mo Fan, are you going to the
Sacred Spring today?

00:09:19.263 --> 00:09:21.589
You should go now,
I will do fine on my own.

00:09:22.201 --> 00:09:23.662
Brother Fan, don't worry about it.

00:09:23.731 --> 00:09:25.638
I can send Xinxia home.

00:09:27.022 --> 00:09:28.967
Okay, I'm going now.

00:09:29.758 --> 00:09:31.611
Good luck on your training.

00:09:48.056 --> 00:09:51.464
You kept us waiting for so long,
where did you get that arrogance?

00:09:52.499 --> 00:09:54.219
Let's go now.

00:10:22.907 --> 00:10:24.880
The Sacred Spring is behind this door.

00:10:25.164 --> 00:10:27.497
You may spend a week
in there for training.

00:10:27.851 --> 00:10:29.424
Mo Fan, take this.

00:10:30.859 --> 00:10:32.046
The Book of Starchart.

00:10:32.473 --> 00:10:33.863
When you reached the level of Starchart,

00:10:33.959 --> 00:10:38.084
use this to create a magic
starchart and release your spell.

00:10:40.527 --> 00:10:43.287
Miss Tang Yue, that is a generous gift.

00:10:44.933 --> 00:10:47.385
This is as far as we can send you.
So long.

00:10:56.325 --> 00:10:57.328
Fan Mo!

00:10:57.329 --> 00:10:58.750
No, I mean Mo Fan.

00:10:58.956 --> 00:11:01.224
-Here you are.
-Xu Dahuang?

00:11:01.792 --> 00:11:05.188
I never thought the alias Fan Mo
is actually yours.

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:09.751
Every mage dreams of coming to
the Spring for training.

00:11:09.955 --> 00:11:11.369
Cherish your time here.

00:11:12.893 --> 00:11:14.128
What are you doing here?

00:11:16.959 --> 00:11:21.001
Do you remember the lost girl from
Epigraph Girls Junior High?

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:27.677
She is the guard of Sacred Spring.

00:11:28.025 --> 00:11:31.652
She is also the sister
of the missing girl.

00:11:32.914 --> 00:11:35.695
It has passed for a long time,
she is still searching for clues.

00:11:36.667 --> 00:11:39.667
Is the case connected to
the Sacred Spring?

00:11:41.127 --> 00:11:44.181
We went into the cave behind
the cafeteria.

00:11:44.479 --> 00:11:47.052
We found tracks of Cyclops.

00:11:47.968 --> 00:11:50.941
We also found an odd liquid.

00:11:51.918 --> 00:11:55.960
We suspect the liquid might be
connected to the Sacred Spring.

00:11:57.485 --> 00:11:58.551
How is this possible?

00:11:59.598 --> 00:12:01.993
All right, just focus on your training.

00:12:02.375 --> 00:12:05.458
Become the second youngest
Nebula mage in Bow City.

00:12:07.726 --> 00:12:10.073
So, who is the youngest Nebula mage?

00:12:10.808 --> 00:12:12.675
Mu Ningxue of course.

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:34.963
-How did it go?
-We have the result.

00:12:35.579 --> 00:12:36.939
Your guess was right.

00:12:37.099 --> 00:12:40.157
This is a type of spring water
similar to that of Sacred Spring.

00:12:42.405 --> 00:12:43.205
Just as I expected.

00:12:43.956 --> 00:12:45.449
But it has the opposite effect.

00:12:45.833 --> 00:12:47.953
It gives creatures the power of rage,

00:12:48.194 --> 00:12:50.127
it even provokes their blood-thirst.

00:12:50.751 --> 00:12:54.502
The Cyclops usually hide inside
the dark from the people.

00:12:55.229 --> 00:12:56.869
And now they are ravaging the land.

00:12:57.422 --> 00:12:59.687
-This must be the reason.
-I am afraid so.

00:13:00.328 --> 00:13:03.115
We dub it the Spring of Rage.

00:13:15.238 --> 00:13:16.252
Are you Mo Fan?

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:29.560
Go in.

00:14:29.895 --> 00:14:31.002
Amazing.

00:14:31.095 --> 00:14:34.406
I could feel the experience gain
just by sitting here.

00:14:35.093 --> 00:14:36.981
This is the power of the Sacred Spring?

00:14:42.178 --> 00:14:44.284
What? Why are you so excited?

00:14:53.079 --> 00:14:54.626
You are spinning
like you could drink it.

00:14:56.395 --> 00:14:59.795
Calm down, I'll get you a girlfriend
after we got out of here.

00:15:34.813 --> 00:15:36.400
The goods were almost ruined.

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.033
I am glad we made it in time.

00:15:38.947 --> 00:15:42.124
Mo Jiaxing, people say your son
made a wave at the Mu Mansion.

00:15:42.196 --> 00:15:43.972
All the factions are trying
to recruit him.

00:15:45.343 --> 00:15:46.609
All thanks to you too.

00:15:47.167 --> 00:15:50.959
Even our boss Zhan Kong
sees him as his equal.

00:15:51.231 --> 00:15:53.351
Why are you still working
as delivery man?

00:15:54.827 --> 00:15:56.294
My work still needs to be done.

00:15:56.501 --> 00:16:01.127
It's a tough job to secure
the safety of Bow City.

00:16:01.334 --> 00:16:05.459
All I can do now is to
send more supplies to you.

00:16:06.155 --> 00:16:07.716
I am just the same as my son,

00:16:07.969 --> 00:16:10.090
we are both proud of our jobs.

00:16:15.846 --> 00:16:18.606
The colour of the rain is odd.

00:16:19.454 --> 00:16:20.600
It looks like pee.

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:28.238
-Is there anything unusual?
-No, everything is normal.

00:16:28.938 --> 00:16:31.711
All patrol squads, high alert
on all perimeter of mountain side.

00:16:31.831 --> 00:16:32.524
Yes!

00:17:06.558 --> 00:17:08.933
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:17:09.636 --> 00:17:13.046
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:17:13.316 --> 00:17:16.367
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:17:17.008 --> 00:17:18.488
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:17:18.889 --> 00:17:20.782
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:17:21.396 --> 00:17:24.442
♪ Dreamt that we will
not wander anymore ♪

00:17:24.774 --> 00:17:28.699
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:17:30.172 --> 00:17:34.097
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:40.037
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:17:41.098 --> 00:17:44.359
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:17:44.671 --> 00:17:47.525
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:17:47.792 --> 00:17:50.117
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:53.168
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:17:53.493 --> 00:17:56.215
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:59.767
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:18:00.093 --> 00:18:02.062
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:18:02.634 --> 00:18:05.731
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:18:06.276 --> 00:18:10.115
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:18:10.703 --> 00:18:16.940
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
